    "detailed_description": "<h1>MORE GAMES FOR KIDS:</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The ultimate fun car game for kids! Use a variety of fun washing tools and remove dirt from cars, trucks, police cars, race cars and more. What sounds like \u201cwork\u201d is actually just a lot of fun!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/17b98810826450ff1a00f37976ebccd4.poster.avif?t=1699692906\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/17b98810826450ff1a00f37976ebccd4.webm?t=1699692906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/17b98810826450ff1a00f37976ebccd4.mp4?t=1699692906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With lots of dirty cars, real water physics and lots of fun car washing tools to clean the cars, monster trucks, etc.<br>Children experience fun 2D animations, music, sounds and illustrations. Long-term fun is guaranteed.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/ecd1b0f72fc235db113707872c0a72ec.poster.avif?t=1699692906\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/ecd1b0f72fc235db113707872c0a72ec.webm?t=1699692906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/ecd1b0f72fc235db113707872c0a72ec.mp4?t=1699692906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can also mix soap colors yourself in a washing laboratory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/96af3708900c799e2fe8378100d6cbaf.poster.avif?t=1699692906\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/96af3708900c799e2fe8378100d6cbaf.webm?t=1699692906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/96af3708900c799e2fe8378100d6cbaf.mp4?t=1699692906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Learn how to use the mouse in a playful way and also learn logical thinking, hand-eye coordination and of course economic thinking, because ultimately the little ones will be rewarded with success by washing the vehicles.<br><br>Who knows... maybe My little Car Wash is the start of a great entrepreneurial career and you have a car wash tycoon in your family. ;)<br><br>Get the fun car game!<br><br>And please don't forget to check out our other games here as we also produce games for adult players.<br><br>Your McPeppergames team",
    "about_the_game": "The ultimate fun car game for kids! Use a variety of fun washing tools and remove dirt from cars, trucks, police cars, race cars and more. What sounds like \u201cwork\u201d is actually just a lot of fun!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/17b98810826450ff1a00f37976ebccd4.poster.avif?t=1699692906\" width=504 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/17b98810826450ff1a00f37976ebccd4.webm?t=1699692906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/17b98810826450ff1a00f37976ebccd4.mp4?t=1699692906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>With lots of dirty cars, real water physics and lots of fun car washing tools to clean the cars, monster trucks, etc.<br>Children experience fun 2D animations, music, sounds and illustrations. Long-term fun is guaranteed.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/ecd1b0f72fc235db113707872c0a72ec.poster.avif?t=1699692906\" width=444 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/ecd1b0f72fc235db113707872c0a72ec.webm?t=1699692906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/ecd1b0f72fc235db113707872c0a72ec.mp4?t=1699692906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You can also mix soap colors yourself in a washing laboratory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/96af3708900c799e2fe8378100d6cbaf.poster.avif?t=1699692906\" width=484 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/96af3708900c799e2fe8378100d6cbaf.webm?t=1699692906\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633230/extras/96af3708900c799e2fe8378100d6cbaf.mp4?t=1699692906\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Learn how to use the mouse in a playful way and also learn logical thinking, hand-eye coordination and of course economic thinking, because ultimately the little ones will be rewarded with success by washing the vehicles.<br><br>Who knows... maybe My little Car Wash is the start of a great entrepreneurial career and you have a car wash tycoon in your family. ;)<br><br>Get the fun car game!<br><br>And please don't forget to check out our other games here as we also produce games for adult players.<br><br>Your McPeppergames team",
    "short_description": "The fun car game for kids! In My Little Car Wash you become your own car wash boss. Clean tons of cars and trucks with lots of fun washing supplies and physics-based water.",
